      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW REX (1) isn't a quick beginner but comes home hard, finishing out of the frame two back but did wind up strongly to place when second (22.69) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Makes plenty of appeal. BUSH PROFIT (6) comes off an average effort last start when seventh at this track over 390m behind Come And See (22.99) in a Grade 4/5. Form from her last run is proving strong. Worth following up. REIKO COMET (3) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at Geelong over 400m. Well placed here and can atone this time. PAW ULTRA (4) was out of placings last time (22.74) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 3.5 lengths. Has already won three times from this draw.",
